Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: inject a verification failure after silent START

Exercise the verified STOP and the no-retry latch on hardware without
inducing a SoundWire fault, enabling a PA, or changing protection clocks.
The marker can only take effect inside the muted zero-ring audit.

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c
